Project updated on wiki: CCN changes: 8.5 update, no changes



<li>Fri Jan 13 03:04:23 2017 version: 8.0.3 user: oreilly file_name: <code>cats_and_dogs.proj</code> <br>
Project updated on wiki: CCN changes: 10446 8.0.4 update



<li>Tue Sep  6 03:11:46 2016 version: 8.0.2 user: oreilly file_name: <code>cats_and_dogs.proj</code> <br>
Project updated on wiki: CCN changes: morris name in std input 


<li>Mon Aug 15 23:50:05 2016 version: 8.0.1 user: oreilly file_name: <code>cats_and_dogs.proj</code> <br>
Updated to 8.0 specs and programs.  No major changes.
</ul>
</body>
</html>
";
   html_text="<html>
<head>ChangeLog</head>
<body>
<h1>ChangeLog</h1>
<ul>
